{"id":"huntik:page:3374","page_id":3374,"title":"Stormshield","kind":"spell","namespace":0,"summary":"Stormshield is a defensive spell. It creates a purple shield around the caster to repulse and redirect offensive spells. It is favored by members of the Blood Spiral.","profile":{"image":{"text":"Stormshield.png","wikitext":"Stormshield.png","links":[]},"aura":{"text":"Violet\nOrange","wikitext":"Violet<br>Orange","links":[]},"class":{"text":"Protective","wikitext":"Protective","links":[]},"users":{"text":"Captain Caine\nHarrison Fears\nRassimov\nTantras","wikitext":"[[Captain Caine]]<br>[[Harrison Fears]]<br>[[Rassimov]]<br>[[Tantras]]","links":[{"target_title":"Captain Caine","label":"Captain Caine","target_id":"huntik:page:14832","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Captain_Caine","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A14832"},{"target_title":"Harrison Fears","label":"Harrison Fears","target_id":"huntik:page:4446","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Harrison_Fears","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4446"},{"target_title":"Rassimov","label":"Rassimov","target_id":"huntik:page:2090","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rassimov","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2090"},{"target_title":"Tantras","label":"Tantras","target_id":"huntik:page:4559","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Tantras","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4559"}]},"first":{"text":"\"The Unseen Guide\"","wikitext":"\"[[The Unseen Guide]]\"","links":[{"target_title":"The Unseen Guide","label":"The Unseen Guide","target_id":"huntik:page:3229","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Unseen_Guide","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3229"}]}},"infoboxes":[{"name":"infobox spell","parameters":[{"name":"image","value_wikitext":"Stormshield.png","value_text":"Stormshield.png","links":[]},{"name":"aura","value_wikitext":"Violet<br>Orange","value_text":"Violet\nOrange","links":[]},{"name":"class","value_wikitext":"Protective","value_text":"Protective","links":[]},{"name":"users","value_wikitext":"[[Captain Caine]]<br>[[Harrison Fears]]<br>[[Rassimov]]<br>[[Tantras]]","value_text":"Captain Caine\nHarrison Fears\nRassimov\nTantras","links":[{"target_title":"Captain Caine","label":"Captain Caine","target_id":"huntik:page:14832","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Captain_Caine","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A14832"},{"target_title":"Harrison Fears","label":"Harrison Fears","target_id":"huntik:page:4446","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Harrison_Fears","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4446"},{"target_title":"Rassimov","label":"Rassimov","target_id":"huntik:page:2090","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rassimov","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2090"},{"target_title":"Tantras","label":"Tantras","target_id":"huntik:page:4559","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Tantras","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4559"}]},{"name":"first","value_wikitext":"\"[[The Unseen Guide]]\"","value_text":"\"The Unseen Guide\"","links":[{"target_title":"The Unseen Guide","label":"The Unseen Guide","target_id":"huntik:page:3229","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Unseen_Guide","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3229"}]}],"start":0,"end":206}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"Stormshield was used by [[Rassimov]] at the [[Temple of Poseidon]] to defend himself against a joint attack from [[Sabriel]] and [[Lindorm]]. {{source|The Unseen Guide}}\n\n[[Captain Caine]] used the spell while fighting [[Lok Lambert]] and [[Sophie Casterwill]] in the underwater city of [[Ys]]. {{Source|The Lost City of Casterwill}}\n\nIn [[Venice, Italy]], Tantras used the spell to redirect [[Dante Vale]]'s [[Touchram]], destroying the shutter of a nearby window. {{source|Boys Will Be Seekers}}\n\n[[Harrison Fears]] used the spell outside the [[Tomb of Nefertiti]] to deflect a [[Raypulse]] from one of [[Klaus]]' [[Suits]]. {{source|Rassimov's Secret}}\n\nDuring the fight against [[the Betrayer]], Harrison used the spell to try to protect [[Zhalia Moon]] against the Betrayer's [[Shocklash]]. {{source|Dante's Return}}\n\n{{clear}}","text":"Stormshield was used by Rassimov at the Temple of Poseidon to defend himself against a joint attack from Sabriel and Lindorm. [The Unseen Guide]\n\nCaptain Caine used the spell while fighting Lok Lambert and Sophie Casterwill in the underwater city of Ys. [The Lost City of Casterwill]\n\nIn Venice, Italy, Tantras used the spell to redirect Dante Vale's Touchram, destroying the shutter of a nearby window. [Boys Will Be Seekers]\n\nHarrison Fears used the spell outside the Tomb of Nefertiti to deflect a Raypulse from one of Klaus' Suits. [Rassimov's Secret]\n\nDuring the fight against the Betrayer, Harrison used the spell to try to protect Zhalia Moon against the Betrayer's Shocklash. [Dante's Return]"},{"heading":"International Names","level":2,"wikitext":"{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR = Bouclier des tempêtes\n|POR=Escudo Relâmpago, Escudo Tempestade}}\n\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Blood Spiral magic]]\n[[Category:Violet-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Orange-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Protective spells]]","text":"French: Bouclier des tempêtes\nPortuguese: Escudo Relâmpago, Escudo Tempestade"}],"full_text":"Stormshield is a defensive spell. It creates a purple shield around the caster to repulse and redirect offensive spells. It is favored by members of the Blood Spiral.\n\n== History ==\nStormshield was used by Rassimov at the Temple of Poseidon to defend himself against a joint attack from Sabriel and Lindorm. [The Unseen Guide]\n\nCaptain Caine used the spell while fighting Lok Lambert and Sophie Casterwill in the underwater city of Ys. [The Lost City of Casterwill]\n\nIn Venice, Italy, Tantras used the spell to redirect Dante Vale's Touchram, destroying the shutter of a nearby window. [Boys Will Be Seekers]\n\nHarrison Fears used the spell outside the Tomb of Nefertiti to deflect a Raypulse from one of Klaus' Suits. [Rassimov's Secret]\n\nDuring the fight against the Betrayer, Harrison used the spell to try to protect Zhalia Moon against the Betrayer's Shocklash. [Dante's Return]\n\n== International Names ==","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox spell\n| image = Stormshield.png\n| aura  = Violet<br>Orange\n| class = Protective\n| users = [[Captain Caine]]<br>[[Harrison Fears]]<br>[[Rassimov]]<br>[[Tantras]]\n| first = \"[[The Unseen Guide]]\"\n}}'''Stormshield''' is a defensive spell. It creates a purple shield around the caster to repulse and redirect offensive spells. It is favored by members of the [[Blood Spiral]].\n\n== History ==\nStormshield was used by [[Rassimov]] at the [[Temple of Poseidon]] to defend himself against a joint attack from [[Sabriel]] and [[Lindorm]]. {{source|The Unseen Guide}}\n\n[[Captain Caine]] used the spell while fighting [[Lok Lambert]] and [[Sophie Casterwill]] in the underwater city of [[Ys]]. {{Source|The Lost City of Casterwill}}\n\nIn [[Venice, Italy]], Tantras used the spell to redirect [[Dante Vale]]'s [[Touchram]], destroying the shutter of a nearby window. {{source|Boys Will Be Seekers}}\n\n[[Harrison Fears]] used the spell outside the [[Tomb of Nefertiti]] to deflect a [[Raypulse]] from one of [[Klaus]]' [[Suits]]. {{source|Rassimov's Secret}}\n\nDuring the fight against [[the Betrayer]], Harrison used the spell to try to protect [[Zhalia Moon]] against the Betrayer's [[Shocklash]]. {{source|Dante's Return}}\n\n{{clear}}\n== International Names ==\n{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR = Bouclier des tempêtes\n|POR=Escudo Relâmpago, Escudo Tempestade}}\n\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Blood Spiral magic]]\n[[Category:Violet-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Orange-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Protective spells]]","categories":["Blood Spiral magic","Magic","Orange-aura spells","Protective spells","Violet-aura spells"],"links":[{"target_title":"Captain Caine","label":"Captain Caine","target_id":"huntik:page:14832","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Captain_Caine","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A14832"},{"target_title":"Harrison Fears","label":"Harrison Fears","target_id":"huntik:page:4446","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Harrison_Fears","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4446"},{"target_title":"Rassimov","label":"Rassimov","target_id":"huntik:page:2090","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rassimov","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2090"},{"target_title":"Tantras","label":"Tantras","target_id":"huntik:page:4559","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Tantras","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4559"},{"target_title":"The Unseen Guide","label":"The Unseen Guide","target_id":"huntik:page:3229","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Unseen_Guide","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3229"},{"target_title":"Blood Spiral","label":"Blood Spiral","target_id":"huntik:page:3288","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Blood_Spiral","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3288"},{"target_title":"Rassimov","label":"Rassimov","target_id":"huntik:page:2090","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rassimov","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2090"},{"target_title":"Temple of Poseidon","label":"Temple of Poseidon","target_id":"huntik:page:5300","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Temple_of_Poseidon","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5300"},{"target_title":"Sabriel","label":"Sabriel","target_id":"huntik:page:2123","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Sabriel","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2123"},{"target_title":"Lindorm","label":"Lindorm","target_id":"huntik:page:3040","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Lindorm","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/hun